# Schema: {"id":"PROMISE-XXXX","chapter":N,"by":"作者|角色名","content":"承诺内容","status":"pending|fulfilled|broken","type":"cliffhanger|emotional|lore|setup","scope":"intra-volume|cross-volume"}
# 只追加不修改；status 可更新
# type: cliffhanger=悬念钩, emotional=情感钩, lore=设定钩, setup=铺垫钩
# scope: intra-volume=本卷回收, cross-volume=跨卷伏笔
# planned_chapter: 计划回收章号（写前预估，可随剧情调整）
# resolved_chapter: 实际回收章号（回收时回填，并将 status 改为 fulfilled）
# 伏笔生命周期：planned_chapter < 当前章且 status:pending -> 逾期；+逾期阈值(默认5)未回收 -> 硬失败
# 示例条目（使用时替换为实际内容，或删除示例从头开始）：
# {"id":"PROMISE-0001","chapter":1,"by":"作者","content":"{配角名}对{某事物}产生好奇，后续章节将{事件描述}","status":"pending","type":"cliffhanger","scope":"intra-volume"}
# {"id":"PROMISE-0002","chapter":1,"by":"作者","content":"{配角名}接了{某任务}，后续章节将因该任务{事件描述}","status":"pending","type":"cliffhanger","scope":"intra-volume"}
# {"id":"PROMISE-0003","chapter":2,"by":"作者","content":"{某角色}在{某场景}与主角互动，后续章节可能登场","status":"pending","type":"setup","scope":"cross-volume"}
